    narr:narration """This narrative gathers two expressions on [the proactive-disclosure commitment](narr:Expr_6HalyardAdvisorTonyMaley20260929_28) — taking a named gap to the board as an open item rather than waiting for discovery — and [the endorsement behind it](narr:Expr_6HalyardAdvisorTonyMaley20260929_29), which argues the principle that a named hole is forgivable while an uncovered one is not. The org-lane style runs antithesis and parallelism.""" ;
